terraform.tfvars

# Terraform provider downloads
**/.terraform/

# Terraform state and temporary state locks
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info

# Local variables and sensitive configuration
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Terraform crash logs and saved plans
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/*.tfplan

# Reusable child-module dependency locks
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
